    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dead by Backrooms Anomaly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/1b35056dcab3e40894287859619d9e38.poster.avif?t=1754802811\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/1b35056dcab3e40894287859619d9e38.webm?t=1754802811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/1b35056dcab3e40894287859619d9e38.mp4?t=1754802811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seeking Love in Dreams!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a dark journey amidst shadows and whispers that will make you question whether you're pursuing truth or your own mind. As you navigate haunted corridors, you'll encounter psychedelic visions and solve puzzles that reveal the secrets of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/5349f852c9110947b2d1a08da2303dcf.poster.avif?t=1754802811\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/5349f852c9110947b2d1a08da2303dcf.webm?t=1754802811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/5349f852c9110947b2d1a08da2303dcf.mp4?t=1754802811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't Play Games with Me!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this exploration-driven, story-driven psychological horror adventure, experienced from an FPS perspective, you'll enter a world where reality and fantasy intertwine through the eyes of a strong female character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/d2e0c70b9ed3756bc2f1bef77725e74e.poster.avif?t=1754802811\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/d2e0c70b9ed3756bc2f1bef77725e74e.webm?t=1754802811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/d2e0c70b9ed3756bc2f1bef77725e74e.mp4?t=1754802811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact: <a href=\"mailto:darkrookinteractive@gmail.com\">darkrookinteractive@gmail.com</a></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dead by Backrooms Anomaly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/1b35056dcab3e40894287859619d9e38.poster.avif?t=1754802811\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/1b35056dcab3e40894287859619d9e38.webm?t=1754802811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/1b35056dcab3e40894287859619d9e38.mp4?t=1754802811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seeking Love in Dreams!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a dark journey amidst shadows and whispers that will make you question whether you're pursuing truth or your own mind. As you navigate haunted corridors, you'll encounter psychedelic visions and solve puzzles that reveal the secrets of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/5349f852c9110947b2d1a08da2303dcf.poster.avif?t=1754802811\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/5349f852c9110947b2d1a08da2303dcf.webm?t=1754802811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/5349f852c9110947b2d1a08da2303dcf.mp4?t=1754802811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't Play Games with Me!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this exploration-driven, story-driven psychological horror adventure, experienced from an FPS perspective, you'll enter a world where reality and fantasy intertwine through the eyes of a strong female character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/d2e0c70b9ed3756bc2f1bef77725e74e.poster.avif?t=1754802811\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/d2e0c70b9ed3756bc2f1bef77725e74e.webm?t=1754802811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639500/extras/d2e0c70b9ed3756bc2f1bef77725e74e.mp4?t=1754802811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact: <a href=\"mailto:darkrookinteractive@gmail.com\">darkrookinteractive@gmail.com</a></h2>",
